{
  "page": 266,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 1873,
      "text": "Dia (Luṭ) berkata, \"Mereka itulah putri-putri (negeri)ku (nikahlah dengan mereka), jika kamu hendak berbuat.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1874,
      "text": "(Allah berfirman), \"Demi umurmu[439] (Muhammad), sungguh, mereka terombang-ambing dalam kemabukan (kesesatan).\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1875,
      "text": "Maka mereka dibinasakan oleh suara keras yang mengguntur, ketika matahari akan terbit,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 73,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1876,
      "text": "maka Kami jungkirbalikan (negeri itu) dan Kami hujani mereka dengan batu dari tanah yang keras.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1877,
      "text": "Sungguh, pada yang demikian itu benar-benar terdapat tanda-tanda (kekuasaan Allah) bagi orang yang memperhatikan tanda-tanda,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 75,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1878,
      "text": "dan sungguh, (negeri) itu benar-benar terletak di jalan yang masih tetap (dilalui manusia).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 76,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1879,
      "text": "Sungguh, pada yang demikian itu benar-benar terdapat tanda (kekuasaan Allah) bagi orang yang beriman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1880,
      "text": "Dan sesungguhnya penduduk Aikah[440] itu benar-benar kaum yang zalim,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1881,
      "text": "Maka Kami membinasakan mereka. Dan sesungguhnya kedua (negeri)[441] itu terletak di satu jalur jalan raya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 222,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1882,
      "text": "Dan sesungguhnya penduduk negeri Hijr[442] benar-benar telah mendustakan para rasul (mereka),[443]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1883,
      "text": "Dan Kami telah mendatangkan kepada mereka tanda-tanda (kekuasaan) Kami, tetapi mereka selalu berpaling darinya,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1884,
      "text": "dan mereka memahat rumah-rumah dari gunung batu, (yang didiami) dengan rasa aman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1885,
      "text": "Kemudian mereka dibinasakan oleh suara keras yang mengguntur pada pagi hari,[444]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 83,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1886,
      "text": "Sehingga tidak berguna bagi mereka apa yang telah mereka usahakan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 84,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1887,
      "text": "Dan Kami tidak menciptakan langit dan bumi serta apa yang ada di antara keduanya melainkan dengan kebenaran. Dan sungguh, Kiamat pasti akan datang, maka maafkanlah (mereka) dengan cara yang baik.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 85,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1888,
      "text": "Sungguh, Tuhanmu, Dialah Yang Maha Pencipta, Maha Mengetahui.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1889,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, Kami telah memberikan kepadamu tujuh (ayat) yang (dibaca) berulang-ulang[445] dan Al-Qur`an yang agung.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1890,
      "text": "Jangan sekali-kali engkau (Muhammad) tujukan pandanganmu kepada kenikmatan hidup yang telah Kami berikan kepada beberapa golongan di antara mereka (orang kafir), dan jangan engkau bersedih hati terhadap mereka dan berendah hatilah engkau terhadap orang yang beriman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1891,
      "text": "Dan katakanlah (Muhammad), \"Sesungguhnya aku adalah pemberi peringatan yang jelas.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 89,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1892,
      "text": "Sebagaimana (Kami telah memberi peringatan), Kami telah menurunkan (azab) kepada orang yang memilah-milah (Kitab Allah),[446]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 90,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 266,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
